{"version":1,"content":"<p>針對網絡流傳的零跑A10後備箱儲物盒被壓塌一事，零跑汽車發佈《關於零跑A10後備廂儲物盒的情況説明》，稱公司高度重視，第一時間聯繫用户並對車輛進行了檢測。經核實，本次受損部件為後備廂蓋板下方的獨立儲物盒，系裝載物品超過其設計承重上限所致，並非後備廂底板或整車承載結構受損。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587360.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.726050+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:00:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_hash":"99fd3d00d9c90f794775e275a6a9230bd06d3c89300d233f5a0cff4d2451d046","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}